{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足其基本输入条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维是强烈推荐而非必需，原文明确允许直接使用归一化表达；reduced_dimensions=present 已满足这一推荐条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，因此 cluster_labels=absent 意味着缺少其算法所依赖的簇划分。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：上述簇划分假设来自未定稿的候选提醒，不代表已批准的科学断言，也不能据此判定执行被阻断。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇仅提供可选的局部监督，不决定所有谱系的数量；缺少 cluster_labels 不构成对谱系发现的硬性限制。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Although terminal state supervision is not required, in many settings researchers do have knowledge of the cell types present in their data and systematically incorporating this knowledge can provide more accurate and stable inference."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 能为每个谱系分配 pseudotime，因此其能力覆盖轨迹推断与 pseudotime 推断两项任务。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "For each lineage, identification of pseudotimes, i.e., a one-dimensional variable representing each cell’s transcriptional progression toward the terminal state."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "是否已有可用的细胞簇划分（cluster partition）？",
    "missing_field": "cluster_partition",
    "why_needed": "Slingshot 的谱系结构推断依赖细胞已被划分为 K 个簇；缺少该信息会改变能否直接开始以及是否需要先进行聚类。"
  }
}
